{"2608610": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Gently Packed", "steam_appid": 2608610, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>Gently Packed </strong>- a relaxing simulation game where you step into the shoes of a cashier working in a charming, cartoon-style store! Your main task is to scan and pack products efficiently, fitting as many items as possible into each bag while maintaining both quality and speed. The better you perform, the bigger the tips you’ll receive from satisfied customers! But that’s not all - as the owner of a franchise for a major corporation, you’ll also manage your store, upgrade it, and pay off the loan you took to start your business.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2608610/extras/2d25457e78cdd3c38a1da9ba9970ae5f.poster.avif?t=1787298001\" width=800 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2608610/extras/2d25457e78cdd3c38a1da9ba9970ae5f.webm?t=1787298001\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2608610/extras/2d25457e78cdd3c38a1da9ba9970ae5f.mp4?t=1787298001\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relaxing Gameplay</strong>: Warm, cartoonish visuals and a calm pace make <strong>Gently Packed </strong> the perfect way to unwind after a long day.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bag Packing Mechanics</strong>: A unique gameplay mechanic that challenges your creativity and precision - can you fit all the groceries into one bag?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Store Management</strong>: Purchase new products, upgrade your store, streamline the checkout process, and keep your customers happy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Seasonal Events &amp; Corporate Challenges</strong>: Handle seasonal promotions, distribute stickers, manage gift cards, and meet corporate demands to keep your store running smoothly.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Easy Mode for Relaxation</strong>: Don’t worry about the pressure - play on Easy Mode and enjoy a stress-free experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2608610/extras/b69ac788068dd9fa78e7e20fbf047eeb.poster.avif?t=1787298001\" width=800 height=408 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2608610/extras/b69ac788068dd9fa78e7e20fbf047eeb.webm?t=1787298001\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2608610/extras/b69ac788068dd9fa78e7e20fbf047eeb.mp4?t=1787298001\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2608610/extras/f751de467aa143d1f7e9525913789e39.avif?t=1787298001\" width=800 height=104 /></span></h2>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>Gently Packed </strong>- a relaxing simulation game where you step into the shoes of a cashier working in a charming, cartoon-style store! Your main task is to scan and pack products efficiently, fitting as many items as possible into each bag while maintaining both quality and speed. The better you perform, the bigger the tips you’ll receive from satisfied customers! But that’s not all - as the owner of a franchise for a major corporation, you’ll also manage your store, upgrade it, and pay off the loan you took to start your business.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2608610/extras/2d25457e78cdd3c38a1da9ba9970ae5f.poster.avif?t=1787298001\" width=800 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2608610/extras/2d25457e78cdd3c38a1da9ba9970ae5f.webm?t=1787298001\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2608610/extras/2d25457e78cdd3c38a1da9ba9970ae5f.mp4?t=1787298001\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relaxing Gameplay</strong>: Warm, cartoonish visuals and a calm pace make <strong>Gently Packed </strong> the perfect way to unwind after a long day.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bag Packing Mechanics</strong>: A unique gameplay mechanic that challenges your creativity and precision - can you fit all the groceries into one bag?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Store Management</strong>: Purchase new products, upgrade your store, streamline the checkout process, and keep your customers happy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Seasonal Events &amp; Corporate Challenges</strong>: Handle seasonal promotions, distribute stickers, manage gift cards, and meet corporate demands to keep your store running smoothly.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Easy Mode for Relaxation</strong>: Don’t worry about the pressure - play on Easy Mode and enjoy a stress-free experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline p